==Description==
'''Sigma''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases the [[Scout]]'s very realistic head. Multiple glitch effects can also be seen. It plays a healing sound when used.

==Trivia==
*This sticker is a reference to the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/sigma-face Sigma Face] meme.
*The sound that plays when using the '''Sigma''' sticker originates from the game ''Undertale''.

